Present WebGL's GLSL version string to Skia in GLES form.

WebGL reports "WebGL GLSL ES 3.00 (...)", which Skia cannot parse, so it
refused the context and painting fell back to the CPU. Both version strings
are now rewritten to their GLES forms.

